    group editorialNotes
    topic "codification"
    heading "Codification"
    p "Sections 210 to 214, sections 10 to 14, respectively, of " ["act June 27, 1934, ch. 868, § 10" -> "/us/act/1934-06-27/ch868/s10"] ", " ["48 Stat. 1288" -> "/us/stat/48/1288"] ", 1289, were omitted as unconstitutional. See " ["section 201 of this title" -> "/us/usc/t45/s201"] "."
    p "Section 210 related to jurisdiction of certain courts."
    p "Section 211 related to exemption of annuities or death payments from legal process."
    p "Section 212 related to penalties for missed payments by carriers and has been omitted from the Code as unconstitutional."
    p "Section 213 related to certain other penalties."
    p "Section 214 related to separability of provisions."
    hash "44a4275c29bd7e5d549365185f7939397a7776a817c8886c404870ae04280a85"
  }
